---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="Journey | Evan" description="Building my digital nomad life in public — every step documented." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="journey-hero">
				<h1>Building in Public</h1>
				<p>Every step of my journey from $0 to a self-sustaining digital nomad business — documented in real time. The wins, the failures, and everything in between.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="journey-list">
				<!-- Day 1 Post -->
				<article class="journey-card pinned">
					<div class="journey-meta">
						<span class="tag">Day 1</span>
						<span class="date">May 7, 2026</span>
					</div>
					<h2>Why I quit Honeywell and what I'm building</h2>
					<p>5 years at a stable corporate job. Then I quit. This is where the journey starts — no audience, no proven results, just the process.</p>
					<a href="/blog/day-1">Read more →</a>
				</article>

				<!-- Placeholder for future posts -->
<!-- Day 5 Post -->
<article class="journey-card">
  <div class="journey-meta">
    <span class="tag">Day 5</span>
    <span class="date">May 11, 2026</span>
  </div>
  <h2>I Built a Website From Scratch. And I Can't Code.</h2>
  <p>Five days in. I launched my personal site — Home, Journey, Shop, About, all live. I had never written a single line of code before this week. Here's what actually happened, including the mistake that broke everything.</p>
<a href="/day-5">Read more →</a>
</article>

<!-- Placeholder for future posts -->
<article class="journey-card">
  <div class="journey-meta">
    <span class="tag">Coming soon</span>
  </div>
  <h2>More updates on the way...</h2>
  <p>I document everything as it happens. Check back soon or follow me on X for daily updates.</p>
  <a href="https://twitter.com/zephyr_8379" target="_blank">Follow on X →</a>
</article>			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		max-width: 860px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1rem;
	}
	.journey-hero {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
	}
	.journey-hero h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.journey-hero p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: #666;
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.journey-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		padding: 2rem 0;
	}
	.journey-card {
		border: 1px solid #eee;
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
	}
	.journey-card.pinned {
		border-color: #000;
		background: #fafafa;
	}
	.journey-meta {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}
	.tag {
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
		padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.date {
		color: #999;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
	.journey-card h2 {
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	.journey-card p {
		color: #555;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.journey-card a {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #000;
	}
</style>